      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In this demonstrator an artificial intelligence (AI) has learned to master
    the game of air hockey by playing against older versions of itself. \n\nIt's
    important to note that the AI has no prior knowledge of the game's rules. Effective
    strategies are incentivized by rewards and penalization. The current version
    of the agent has played over 300.000 matches during training.\n\nThis principle
    of AI is not limited to games but can be applied to industrial use-cases as well
    such as machine parameter optimization and robot control."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
